  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "になる(くなる）USAGE\n\n い形容詞 （−い＋く）＋なる\n Example  たかい >>>たかくなる\n\n な形容詞 （−な＋に）＋なる\n Example  きれいな >>>きれいになる\n\n 名詞 （＋に）＋なる\n Example  かくし>>かくしになる",
      "html": "<b> になる(くなる）USAGE<br/><br/> い形容詞 </b>（−い＋く）＋なる<br/><strong> Example  たか<strong>い &gt;&gt;&gt;たか<strong>くなる<br/><br/><b> な形容詞 </b>（−な＋に）＋なる<br/><strong> Example  きれい<strong>な &gt;&gt;&gt;きれい<strong>になる<br/><br/><b> 名詞 </b>（＋に）＋なる<br/><strong> Example  かくし<strong>&gt;&gt;かくし<strong>になる </strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong></strong>",
      "credits_raw": "moomoochoo",
      "content_sha256": "f273c74ac09fbfb2833115b1af962f59c7cad01d8c3c72726322be743af64283",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Is there a difference between -となる and -になる??",
      "html": "Is there a difference between -となる and -になる??",
      "credits_raw": "drgon76",
      "content_sha256": "800f1defe110ecf74065b13e8ab58f4d03cbc9019a42bdc3187f920a46917214",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "in the example above the と is a half of こと 「事 」\nI think it is almost always になる \nに as in \"to\" (a place). maybe sometimes its omitted.\n　大変となります...\nsomeone native will have to answer...",
      "html": "in the example above the と is a half of こと 「事 」<br/>I think it is almost always になる <br/>に as in \"to\" (a place). maybe sometimes its omitted.<br/>　大変となります...<br/>someone native will have to answer...",
      "credits_raw": "your name",
      "content_sha256": "25334ca9489d390326d22324fce879f0e09f5bf2c552c08979f9c2b974302101",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "One would say 大変なことになります in stead of 大変となります.",
      "html": "One would say 大変なことになります in stead of 大変となります.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "71e018979086bc6b7a4104020482e32ae808628bcd37b11998796242775168d1",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "ざっと計算しても means \"even with a rough computation\" and there is no meaning to it which would suggest \"Even though I budget all the time.\"",
      "html": "ざっと計算しても means \"even with a rough computation\" and there is no meaning to it which would suggest \"Even though I budget all the time.\"",
